<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 81-2 AT TEA V ZIMBABWE (375).</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 81-2 AT TEA V ZIMBABWE (375).</headline>
<dateline>SHEIKHUPURA, Pakistan 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan were 81-2 at tea in reply to Zimbabwe's first innings of 375 on the second day of the first test on Friday.</p>
</text>
